<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Veeco EPS view raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Veeco EPS view raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- SoundView Financial Group Inc said it raised its 1997 earnings estimate on Veeco Instruments Inc to $1.53 a share from $1.50 a share.</p>
<p>-- said the 1998 estimate remains unchanged at $1.85 a share.</p>
<p>-- said the rating remains unchanged at short-term and long-term buy.</p>
<p>-- Veeco gained one to 34-3/4.</p>
</text>
